              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಾಲ ಕೊಡು (sāla koḍu) is native Dravidian: sāla, \"debt\", which DEDR 2472 lists, and koḍu, \"to give\" (DEDR 2053): \"to give a debt\"."
